The full expression is:


\[
\kappa(t)
= \frac{
\left|
\left(r_0 + Ce^{-\Lambda t}\right)
\left(\Lambda C e^{-\Lambda t}\right)\omega
\right|
}{
\left[
(\Lambda C e^{-\Lambda t})^2
+ (r_0 + Ce^{-\Lambda t})^2\omega^2
\right]^{3/2}
