Define the inclusion


\[
i : \mathcal{M}_{\text{golden}} \hookrightarrow \mathbb{R}^2.
\]



Since $\mathcal{M}_{\text{golden}}$ is invariant under the flow,


\[
X|_{\mathcal{M}_{\text{golden}}}
