Formally, for any object $(M,X)$ and morphism


\[
f : (M,X) \to \mathcal{G},
\]


there exists a unique factorization


\[
(M,X) \xrightarrow{g} (\mathcal{C},X|_{\mathcal{C}}) \xrightarrow{i} \mathcal{G}.
\]



