\subsection{Categorical Summary}

\begin{itemize}
\item The CGHDS is an object in $\mathbf{Dyn}$.
\item The golden manifold is a subobject.
\item The golden ring is a terminal subobject.
\item The stable manifold is a fiber over the ring.
\item The system is $D_8$-equivariant.
